{\normalsize\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 關於本書}\qquad{\itshape\normalsize\color{CoverGoldBright} About This Book}

\vspace{0.2cm}
\begin{minipage}{5in}
\setlength{\parskip}{0.15em}
\footnotesize\color{CoverCream}
本書逐章研讀彼得後書三章，整合老弟兄查經方法論、
John MacArthur 逐節解經、G. Campbell Morgan 屬靈組織分析，
並貫通彼得前書、猶大書與啟示錄。
全書以彼得後書 3:18 為總綱：
「你們卻要在我們主──救主耶穌基督的恩典和知識上有長進。
願榮耀歸給他，從今直到永遠。阿們！」

{\color{CoverCream}A chapter-by-chapter study of all three chapters of 2 Peter, integrating the Thursday Bible class method, John MacArthur's verse-by-verse exposition, and G. Campbell Morgan's spiritual analysis --- framed by 2 Peter 3:18's charge to grow in the grace and knowledge of our Lord and Savior Jesus Christ.}
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.22cm}

